\begin{claim} There exists a $\delta'$ so that when $p(\hat K_3;G)-\varsigma_n\le \delta'$, at most $\frac{\varepsilon}{3}\binom{n}{2}$ edges in $\bigcup_{i\ne j}V_i\ast V_j$ need to be recolored so that the only monochromatic triangles in $G$ are contained within the $V_i$.
